--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_02_EncryptedTraffic
  questionId: TECH-02
  category: 1
  speakerName: Principal Security Architect
  questionText: >-
    The customer asks how your platform handles encrypted traffic visibility without creating privacy or compliance issues. What is your answer?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_02_A1
  answerText: >-
    Explain metadata, policy controls, and inspection boundaries, then ask about their regulated data constraints.
  technicalDelta: 3
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_02_A2
  answerText: >-
    Say decryption is always recommended if they want real security.
  technicalDelta: 2
  commercialDelta: 0
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_02_A3
  answerText: >-
    Focus on executive risk reporting and avoid the privacy detail.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 0
  energyDelta: 0
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_TECH_02_A4
  answerText: >-
    Separate what the product observes by default from what requires explicit customer policy decisions.
  technicalDelta: 3
  commercialDelta: 1
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 0
